Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.05,0:02:11.44,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}世人的眼光中我烈焰焚身
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.63,0:02:17.79,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}眼神中期盼著甜蜜殺戮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.02,0:02:24.34,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}現在我的心中燃起了一簇烈火
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.75,0:02:32.52,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}以我殘軀化烈火
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.87,0:03:01.58,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}這簇失控的火焰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.58,0:03:02.38,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}讓我把這座城市燒成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.38,0:03:03.23,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.23,0:03:04.05,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.05,0:03:05.44,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.71,0:03:15.51,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}讓我把這座城市燒成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.51,0:03:16.36,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒啊
